Package: libpulse-dev
Version: @DEB_PULSEAUDIO_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/PulseAudio/
Depends: libpulse0
Provides: libpulse-simple-dev
Conflicts: libpulse-simple-xios-dev
Replaces: libpulse-simple-xios-dev
Description: PulseAudio client libraries - development files
 Headers, pkg-config files and unversioned library links for the PulseAudio
 client libraries. Needed on-device for the gnome-shell introspection build.
 Ships the real libpulse-simple.pc and supersedes the libpulse-simple-xios-dev
 shim.
